{%- comment -%} FAQ structured data — AEO/GEO direct-answer extraction. {%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "How long does a custom mosaic take to make?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Each mosaic is handcrafted to order, with a typical production time of about 4 to 5 weeks. Worldwide shipping then usually takes around 10 days, so most orders arrive within roughly 5 to 7 weeks from confirmation. Larger or highly detailed pieces may take a little longer." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "What happens after I place my order?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "You receive an order confirmation right away. For custom pieces, our design team then collaborates with you on size, colors, and layout and sends a design for your approval. Once approved, a team of 4 to 10 master artisans begins hand-cutting your mosaic." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can I approve the design before my mosaic is made?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. For custom commissions you approve the design before production begins, so your finished mosaic matches your vision. Because each piece is handmade from natural materials, slight, unique variations in color and texture are normal." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "How is my mosaic packaged and shipped?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Your mosaic is mounted on fiber-mesh sheets and packaged with thick paper and heavy-duty polyester film. Pieces up to 10 sq. ft. ship in one piece, rolled like a carpet; larger pieces are split into clearly numbered sections. Every order ships free worldwide with tracking." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need a professional to install my mosaic?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "It's entirely up to you. Mosaics arrive as ready-to-mount sheets, with larger pieces numbered for easy assembly like a puzzle, so many customers install them themselves by following our installation guide. If you prefer, you can also have a tile professional install it. Either way, we're happy to help — just contact us." } },
    { "@type": "Question", "name": "What if my mosaic arrives damaged?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Every mosaic is inspected, slip-tested, and carefully packaged before shipping, and all pieces are backed by a lifetime warranty. In the rare event of an issue, contact us within 14 days and we will make it right." } }
  ]
}
</script>
<style>
  .doc { background:#F4F6FA; color:#16335E; }
  .doc-i { font-style:italic; color:#2B7BE8; }
  .doc-hero { background:#EEF1F6; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(22,51,94,.08); }
  .doc-hero__crumb { max-width:1320px; margin:0 auto; padding:30px 40px 0; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#7E8AA0; }
  .doc-hero__crumb a:hover { color:#2B7BE8; }
  .doc-sep { color:#B7C0D2; } .doc-cur { color:#16335E; }
  .doc-hero__head { max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; padding:46px 40px 56px; text-align:center; }
  .doc-eyebrow { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:22px; font-family:'Marcellus',serif; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.36em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#16335E; }
  .doc-eyebrow__ln { width:38px; height:1px; background:#2B7BE8; }
  .doc-hero__title { font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.01em; margin:0 0 22px; color:#16335E; }
  .doc-hero__sub { font-size:17px; line-height:1.7; color:#5E6B85; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; }

  .doc-wrap { max-width:860px; margin:0 auto; padding:72px 40px 20px; }
  .doc-lead { font-size:18px; line-height:1.75; color:#4A5468; text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 20px; }
  .doc-timebadge { text-align:center; margin:0 auto 54px; }
  .doc-timebadge span { display:inline-block; background:#EEF1F6; border:1px solid rgba(22,51,94,.12); color:#16335E; font-family:'Marcellus',serif; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:10px 22px; }

  .tl { position:relative; margin:0 0 20px; }
  .tl::before { content:""; position:absolute; left:23px; top:8px; bottom:8px; width:2px; background:linear-gradient(#2B7BE8, rgba(43,123,232,.2)); }
  .tl-step { position:relative; padding:0 0 42px 76px; }
  .tl-step:last-child { padding-bottom:0; }
  .tl-step__num { position:absolute; left:0; top:0; width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%; background:#16335E; color:#fff; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(22,51,94,.18); }
  .tl-step__t { font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:25px; line-height:1.2; color:#16335E; margin:4px 0 6px; }
  .tl-step__time { display:inline-block; font-family:'Marcellus',serif; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#2B7BE8; margin:0 0 10px; }
  .tl-step__d { font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.76; color:#4A5468; margin:0; }
  .tl-step__d a { color:#2B7BE8; }

  .doc-sec { margin:60px 0 54px; }
  .doc-sec__eyebrow { font-family:'Marcellus',serif; font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.28em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#2B7BE8; margin-bottom:14px; text-align:center; }
  .doc-sec__title { font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,40px); line-height:1.12; margin:0 0 28px; color:#16335E; text-align:center; }
  .doc-faq__item { border-top:1px solid #E3E8F0; padding:24px 2px; }
  .doc-faq__item:last-child { border-bottom:1px solid #E3E8F0; }
  .doc-faq__q { font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:22px; line-height:1.3; color:#16335E; margin:0 0 10px; }
  .doc-faq__a { font-size:15.5px; line-height:1.76; color:#4A5468; margin:0; }

  .doc-cta { background:#16335E; color:#EAE1D2; text-align:center; }
  .doc-cta__inner { max-width:720px; margin:0 auto; padding:76px 40px; }
  .doc-cta__title { font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:500; font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,42px); line-height:1.12; margin:0 0 14px; color:#fff; }
  .doc-cta__text { font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#9AA4B8; margin:0 auto 30px; max-width:520px; }
  .doc-cta__btns { display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .doc-cta__btn { background:#2B7BE8; color:#fff; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:18px 40px; display:inline-block; transition:background .25s ease; }
  .doc-cta__btn:hover { background:#1E63C4; }
  .doc-cta__btn--ghost { background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
  .doc-cta__btn--ghost:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); }

  @media (max-width:760px) {
    .doc-wrap { padding:48px 22px 10px; }
    .doc-hero__crumb, .doc-hero__head { padding-left:22px; padding-right:22px; }
    .tl-step { padding-left:66px; }
    .tl::before { left:21px; }
    .tl-step__num { width:44px; height:44px; font-size:20px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="doc">
  <section class="doc-hero">
    <div class="doc-hero__crumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span class="doc-sep">/</span><span class="doc-cur">Our Process</span></div>
    <div class="doc-hero__head">
      <div class="doc-eyebrow"><span class="doc-eyebrow__ln"></span>Our Process<span class="doc-eyebrow__ln"></span></div>
      <h1 class="doc-hero__title">From Order to <span class="doc-i">Your Wall</span></h1>
      <p class="doc-hero__sub">Every iMosaicArt piece is handcrafted to order. Here's exactly what happens after you place your order — step by step — so you know what to expect at every stage.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="doc-wrap">
    <p class="doc-lead">We hold no stock. The moment your order is confirmed, a team of master artisans begins creating your mosaic by hand, just for you.</p>
    <div class="doc-timebadge"><span>Typical timeline: ~5–7 weeks from order to delivery</span></div>

    <div class="tl">
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">1</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">Day 0</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Order Confirmed</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">You place your order and receive an instant confirmation. For custom commissions, our design team reaches out to begin shaping your piece.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">2</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">Custom orders</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Design &amp; Approval</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">For bespoke pieces, we collaborate with you on size, colors, and layout — and can create your mosaic from a photo, a painting, or an idea. You approve the design before we begin. Browse our <a href="/pages/color-palette">color palette</a> to choose your tones.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">3</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">~4–5 weeks</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Handcrafted by Master Artisans</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">A team of 4 to 10 skilled artisans hand-cut and hand-set every tessera from natural marble or hand-cut glass, using traditional Roman techniques. This is where your one-of-a-kind piece comes to life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">4</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">Before it ships</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Quality &amp; Slip Test</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">Each mosaic is inspected for detail and finish, and slip-tested to ensure it's safe for floors, pools, and walk-on areas. See the full <a href="/pages/technical-details">technical details</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">5</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">Secure packaging</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Carefully Packaged</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">Your mosaic is mounted on fiber-mesh and wrapped in thick paper and heavy-duty polyester film. Pieces up to 10 sq. ft. ship rolled like a carpet; larger pieces are split into clearly numbered sections for easy assembly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">6</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">~10 days transit</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Free Worldwide Shipping</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">Your order is dispatched with tracking and ships free anywhere in the world, arriving safely at your door in about ten days.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step">
        <div class="tl-step__num">7</div>
        <div class="tl-step__time">At home</div>
        <h2 class="tl-step__t">Delivery &amp; Easy Assembly</h2>
        <p class="tl-step__d">Install your ready-to-mount sheets — numbered like a puzzle for larger pieces. Our <a href="/pages/installation-guide">installation guide</a> walks you through it, and every mosaic is backed by a lifetime warranty.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="doc-sec">
      <div class="doc-sec__eyebrow">Common Questions</div>
      <h2 class="doc-sec__title">Order Process FAQ</h2>
      <div class="doc-faq">
        <div class="doc-faq__item">
          <h3 class="doc-faq__q">How long does a custom mosaic take to make?</h3>
          <p class="doc-faq__a">Each mosaic is handcrafted to order, with a typical production time of about 4–5 weeks. Worldwide shipping then usually takes around 10 days, so most orders arrive within roughly 5–7 weeks from confirmation. Larger or highly detailed pieces may take a little longer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-faq__item">
          <h3 class="doc-faq__q">What happens after I place my order?</h3>
          <p class="doc-faq__a">You receive an order confirmation right away. For custom pieces, our design team then collaborates with you on size, colors, and layout and sends a design for your approval. Once approved, a team of 4–10 master artisans begins hand-cutting your mosaic.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-faq__item">
          <h3 class="doc-faq__q">Can I approve the design before my mosaic is made?</h3>
          <p class="doc-faq__a">Yes — for custom commissions you approve the design before production begins. Because each piece is handmade from natural materials, slight, unique variations in color and texture are normal and make your mosaic one of a kind.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-faq__item">
          <h3 class="doc-faq__q">How is my mosaic packaged and shipped?</h3>
          <p class="doc-faq__a">Your mosaic is mounted on fiber-mesh sheets and packaged with thick paper and heavy-duty polyester film. Pieces up to 10 sq. ft. ship in one piece, rolled like a carpet; larger pieces are split into clearly numbered sections. Every order ships free worldwide with tracking.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-faq__item">
          <h3 class="doc-faq__q">Do I need a professional to install my mosaic?</h3>
          <p class="doc-faq__a">It's entirely up to you. Mosaics arrive as ready-to-mount sheets — larger pieces numbered for easy assembly like a puzzle — so many customers install them themselves by following our installation guide. If you prefer, you can also have a tile professional install it. Either way, we're happy to help; just contact us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-faq__item">
          <h3 class="doc-faq__q">What if my mosaic arrives damaged?</h3>
          <p class="doc-faq__a">Every mosaic is inspected, slip-tested, and carefully packaged before shipping, and all pieces are backed by a lifetime warranty. In the rare event of an issue, contact us within 14 days and we'll make it right.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="doc-cta">
    <div class="doc-cta__inner">
      <h2 class="doc-cta__title">Ready to Start Your Piece?</h2>
      <p class="doc-cta__text">Commission a one-of-a-kind mosaic, or book a free consultation with our design experts to plan it together.</p>
      <div class="doc-cta__btns">
        <a href="/pages/custom-mosaics" class="doc-cta__btn">Start a Custom Mosaic</a>
        <a href="/pages/free-consultation" class="doc-cta__btn doc-cta__btn--ghost">Book a Free Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
